             <h2>Store FAQ</h2>
        <h3>Finding your special Tea</h3>
      <p>If you are unable to locate the product you are after, please visit the <a href="/pages/special-order"><span class="bold_faq underlin_faq" style="color: #333">‘Special Order’</span></a> page, fill out the details and submit it to us. We will review your enquiry and get in touch with you within 1-3 business days.</p>
       
        <h3>Finding your Tea locally</h3>
        <p>Dilmah is available in many countries, however all varieties of our teas are not available everywhere. You can find the distributors/contact point given on the pack (for large distributors) online or by contacting us at 
          <a href="mailto:consumer@dilmahtea.com">consumer@dilmahtea.com</a> </p>
          <p>For bulk orders please email us with your Company Profile and brands you represent, to <a href="mailto:marketing@dilmahtea.com">marketing@dilmahtea.com</a> </p>
      
      
      <h3>Why you should register with Dilmah Online Shop</h3>
      <p>Signing up for a Dilmah Online Shop account also entitles you to our loyalty program. Your account is your special page which consists of all the information you have provided including your past orders. You will also be able to view and track your current orders along with the transit location of your shipped orders.</p>
      
      <p>We periodically send you Newsletters with promotional products, discounts and notices when limited edition rare teas are introduced. Please don’t forget to tick the Newsletter subscription.</p>
      <p>Registered customers can request for special custom product bundles via <a class="bold_faq" href="/pages/special-order">Special Order Page</a></p>
      
      <h3>Countries we ship to</h3>
      <p>We ship to most of the countries in the world and you can view the list in Shipping Information Page </p>
      <p>If your country of choice is not listed here, please write to us on <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_txt">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> prior to placing your order and we will confirm whether we are able to arrange shipment for you.</p>
      <p>Commonwealth Independent State (CIS) countries such as Russia and Ukraine require special import documents registered to a company, which is not generally available to consumers. If you have the necessary import clearance for CIS countries, please contact us on <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> before placing an order. </p>
      
      <h3>I have paid for the order but have not received a confirmation</h3>
      <p>Your order payments are confirmed on-screen as well as by an order confirmation email. Leave a few minutes after payment and check your inbox and spam folder for your order confirmation. If you encounter any error message on-screen or did not receive an order confirmation, please contact us at <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> before attempting a new order.</p>
      <p>If you have already placed multiple orders and wish to cancel, please contact us at <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a>.</p>
     <br>
      <p>Please add <span class="bold_faq">@dilmahtea.com</span> to your spam filter white list.</p>
      
      <h3>I have requested to reset my password but have not received a reply</h3>
      <p>Your password recovery requests are sent by email. Leave a few minutes after your request and check your inbox and spam folder. If you encounter any error message on-screen or did not receive the password recovery email, please contact us at <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> before attempting a new request. Please add <span class="bold_faq">@dilmahtea.com</span> to your spam filter white list</p>
      
      <h3>I see a “Page Expired” message</h3>
      <p>This may happen due to many reasons. Your page may have timed-out, hence please refresh the page or go back one step and re-try filling the form. If the error persists, please contact us at <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a>.</p>
      
      <h3>Changing Delivery Locations</h3>

      <p>Orders can be shipped to a different address other than your billing address at the time of order. However if you wish to change the shipping address after placing the order, please inform us at&nbsp; <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> before 24 Hours have passed since the order placement.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
If the order has already been shipped, we will request our shipping partner to re-route it to your new address. Any additional charges involved will not be borne by Dilmah Ceylon Tea Company PLC.</p>

<h3>Extra Charges after initial payment (Custom duty/taxes)</h3>

<p><br />
Each of the countries we ship to, has their own regulatory laws in place. Therefore, they may levy certain taxes on your purchase, and it is your responsibility to check on these prior to placing your order, The prices offered online are exclusive of local duty/taxes imposed by the respective countries, destination countries customs office duty/taxes will not be borne by Dilmah Ceylon Tea Company PLC.</p>

<h3>Flavouring Agents</h3>

<p><br />
  We use many flavor types and formats for the variety of teas offered. If you require specific information regarding a flavour format or type used in any of our teas, please contact us on&nbsp;<a href="mailto:consumer@dilmahtea.com"   class="bold_faq underlin_faq">consumer@dilmahtea.com</a></p>

<h3>Ordering Customized Quantities</h3>

<p><br />
We offer refill packs and tea caddies that are optimised for economical shipping. &nbsp;<br />
  If you prefer to order a custom pack or quantity contact us on&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com"   class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a>.&nbsp;</p>

<h3>Bulk orders for Establishments</h3>

<p><br />
  The prices offered are for individual consumers and if you require larger quantities, please contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com"   class="bold_faq underlin_faq">marketing@dilmahtea.com</a>&nbsp;for a custom quote.</p>

<h3>My Payments are not going through</h3>

<p><br />
Payments may fail due to many reasons and the following are the most common:<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
  <li><span   class="bold_faq">Corporate Credit Cards</span> &ndash; Only personal credit cards are accepted, please use an appropriate credit card.</li>
  <li><span   class="bold_faq">Time Out / Page Expired</span> &ndash; contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com"  class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> before re-trying payment&nbsp;</li>
  <li><span   class="bold_faq">Insufficient Funds</span> &ndash; Please speak to your bank</li>
  <li><span   class="bold_faq">Fraud (black listed card or bank) </span>&ndash; Please speak to your bank</li>
  <li><span   class="bold_faq">Secondary Authentication Failed</span> &ndash; Please keep your secondary authentication device nearby for quick access</li>
</ul>

<h3>Buying Accessories</h3>

<p>
  We offer a select range of&nbsp;accessories&nbsp;online, which can be safely transported internationally. However if you wish to have an item which is not offered online please contact us at&nbsp;<a class="bold_faq underlin_faq" href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> with a picture or any identifiable characteristic of the item.</p>

<h3>Gift of Tea (Gift wrap and personal messages)</h3>

<p>
We offer you the opportunity to send gifts direct from Sri Lanka to any of the countries we ship to, saving you the time and cost of re-shipping.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
You could request for the teas to be gift wrapped along with your personal message when you reach the Shopping Cart by clicking on the gift item.</p>

<h3>Privacy and security of your payments and credit card numbers</h3>

<p>
  When you pay for your order, the information is directly typed on to the bank&rsquo;s (<span class="bold_faq">payment gateway</span>) secure websites; we do not receive or retain your payment or credit card information on our website.</p>

<h3>Invoice for Orders</h3>

<p>
  Your order confirmation contains all the necessary information for an invoice. However if you require a special invoice for reimbursement or documentation purposes please contact us at&nbsp;<a class="bold_faq underlin_faq" href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> with your order number.</p>

<h3>I have only received a part of my order</h3>

<p>
We ship your complete order under a single airway bill unless notified prior. However a single airway bill could contain multiple boxes which may be delivered in part by the courier.<br />
  If you need any more information please contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> with your order number.</p>

<h3>Order Cancellation</h3>

<p>
  Orders may be cancelled by notice to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> up to 48 hours from the date of order placement, and if the parcel is not already in transit.<br />
If the order has already been shipped and in the transit, we are unable to cancel the order placed.</p>

<h3>Direct Fund Transfer</h3>

<p>
We accept payments via Visa, Master, American Express credit cards and Paypal. Payments via any money transfer services such as Western Union or TT are discouraged due to high overhead costs for transferring small amounts of funds.<br />
Alternatively you could get a cashier&rsquo;s cheque drawn in favour of &ldquo;Dilmah Ceylon Tea Company PLC&rdquo; and mail it to, # 111, Negombo Road, Peliyagoda, Sri Lanka.</p>

<h3>My order has been damaged</h3>

<p>
We make sure that items are packed securely with necessary padding and support. However we have noticed that some boxes have been opened by local customs for inspection and have been damaged in the process.</p>

<p>Our courier partners are trustworthy, hence when they deliver your package to your door-step they will request for a signatory to sign and claim the parcel. If however there is no such possibility, you can also request that the package be left outside although doing so will be entirely at your own risk.</p>

      <p>If you receive any items that are damaged please contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com"  class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> with a few pictures of the damage before 14 days of delivery so that we could request the courier for compensation.</p>

<h3>Special Documents for Custom/FDA Clearance</h3>

<p>
We include FDA Prior Notification Forms for all Tea orders shipped to USA or Canada and Phythosanitary Certificates for all orders shipped to Europe and South America.</p>

      <p>Please contact us at&nbsp;<a  href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> should you require any other documents which may help to clear your teas faster and cheaper.</p>
<br>
<p><strong>India</strong>:&nbsp;You will be requested to provide a Clearance Authority Letter and KYC form by the courier at the time of clearance.</p>
<br>
      <p><strong>Turkey, Brazil or Chile:&nbsp;</strong>Please provide your TAX ID or RUT Number along with your order. You could also send it to us on&nbsp;
        <a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> with your order number.<br />
&nbsp;</p>

  <h3>Currency</h3>

<p>
You could view your items in US Dollar and the final payment will be in US Dollar at the applicable bank&rsquo;s exchange rate for your local currency.&nbsp;</p>

<h3>Free Samples</h3>

<p>
  If you wish to obtain some free samples, please send us a mail on&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com"  class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a>.&nbsp;</p>

<h3>Airway bill Tracking says Cancelled by Sender</h3>

<p>
Please allow for 24 hours for the updates to appear. The airway bill number that you have received via a shipment confirmation may have been revised due to unavoidable circumstances.</p>

      <p>Please log into your account to view the revised airway bill number. Please contact us at&nbsp;<a href="mailto:orders@dilmahtea.com" class="bold_faq underlin_faq">orders@dilmahtea.com</a> if you require any information on your order.<br />
&nbsp;</p>
    
   <h3>Personalised Presenters</h3>   
      <p>We are pleased to offer an additional service such as your name or company name laser engraved on selected presenters. As we have a 30 character limit inclusive of spaces on our engraving facility, you will have to improvise a bit!</p>
     <br>
      <p>Furthermore, please note that we charge a small fee for this facility, unless we have an on-going promotion regarding the same.</p>
      
      
